time Note

scale slot 12s 6
row block
point C at 0
zoom 0-2

box proposer [note: one is picked]
box block

step Small text
  say note adds small text under the box name.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0

step Rewrite
  say A note line inside a step rewrites the state of a point.
  note C: Proposed
